<h2>The Challenge</h2>

<div class="side-by-side">
  <div>
    <p class="big">
      {{ subtitle }}
    </p>
  </div>
  <p>
    Proving Grounds is a long-running pro-am esports series, and it needed a
    brand refresh that felt modern and kept its roots. We needed a modular
    design system that works across broadcast graphics, social media, and live
    tournament branding and helps the series stand out in a crowded space. The
    refresh also had to keep the underdog spirit that makes the tournament
    unique.
  </p>
</div>

