<div>
  <h2>The Solution</h2>

  <div class="side-by-side">
    <p class="big">Street Art and Esports</p>
    <p>
      To reflect the underdog mentality, we drew on street art culture and
      introduced an alternate PG icon with a graffiti-inspired look. It reflects
      the tournament's grassroots origins and looks modern.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="side-by-side">
    <p class="big">A Scalable Motion System</p>
    <p>
      We combined the legacy branding with a futuristic motion system inspired
      by early 2000s design.
    </p>
  </div>
</div>

